msgid "After installation:"
msgstr "安装完成后："

#: ../../source/developer/build.rst:74
msgid "Qt will be installed at: ``C:\\Qt\\5.15.2\\mingw81_64``."
msgstr "Qt 将安装到：``C:\\Qt\\5.15.2\\mingw81_64``。"

#: ../../source/developer/build.rst:75
msgid "MinGW will be available at: ``C:\\Qt\\Tools\\mingw810_64\\bin``."
msgstr "MinGW 将位于：``C:\\Qt\\Tools\\mingw810_64\\bin``。"

#: ../../source/developer/build.rst:77
msgid ""
"After completing the installation, set the two PATH Variables for the KDE "
"Step."
msgstr "完成安装后，为 KDE 步骤设置两个 PATH 变量。"

#: ../../source/developer/build.rst:80
msgid "Set the QTPATH Variable"
msgstr "设置 QTPATH 变量"

#: ../../source/developer/build.rst:81
msgid ""
"Set the ``QTPATH`` environment variable to point to your Qt installation "
"directory. For example:"
msgstr "将 ``QTPATH`` 环境变量设置为指向你的 Qt 安装目录。例如："

#: ../../source/developer/build.rst:88
msgid "Add MinGW to PATH"
msgstr "将 MinGW 添加到 PATH"

#: ../../source/developer/build.rst:90
msgid ""
"Add the following directory to your ``PATH`` environment variable: "
"``C:\\Qt\\Tools\\mingw810_64\\bin``"
msgstr "将以下目录添加到 ``PATH`` 环境变量：``C:\\Qt\\Tools\\mingw810_64\\bin``"

#: ../../source/developer/build.rst:93
msgid "Verify installation:"
msgstr "验证安装："

#: ../../source/developer/build.rst:100
msgid "Install CMake"
msgstr "安装 CMake"

#: ../../source/developer/build.rst:102
msgid "Download and install `CMake`_."
msgstr "下载并安装 `CMake <CMake_>`_。"

#: ../../source/developer/build.rst:103
msgid "Add CMake to your system ``PATH`` during installation."
msgstr "安装过程中将 CMake 添加到系统 ``PATH``。"

